{"overview":"الینور کوپولا دوربینش را به سمت دخترش، سوفیا، که در حال فیلم‌برداری «ماری آنتوانت» است، می‌گیرد. او جزئیات پشت صحنه و صحنه‌های روی صحنه را به دقت ثبت می‌کند، دستاورد سوفیا در کارگردانی یک فیلم تاریخی در سن ۳۴ سالگی را به تصویر می‌کشد و درباره معنای مادر بودن در حالی که دخترش کار می‌کند، تأمل می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Eleanor Coppola turns her camera on her daughter, Sofia, as she shoots Marie Antoinette. Catching every detail of the behind-the-scenes and on-set action, Eleanor captures the feat of Sofia’s directing a landmark film aged 34, and muses on what it means for a mother to watch her daughter at work.","tagline_en":"","runtime":86,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Eleanor Coppola"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IT","FR","US"],"cast":[{"name":"داین لین","role":"Eleanor Coppola (voice)","photo":"/6OfP3vFMuCL51zamFKgb8aS74hs.jpg","en":"Diane Lane"},{"name":"سوفیا کوپولا","role":"Self","photo":"/dzHC2LxmarkBxWLhjp2DRa5oCev.jpg","en":"Sofia Coppola"},{"name":"کیرستن دانست","role":"Self","photo":"/yhLKGjuiMMdbGnFrR8AREkCZcVF.jpg","en":"Kirsten Dunst"},{"name":"جیسون شوارتزمن","role":"Self","photo":"/gCjMdmW1DiPAClHVl4zHEIffIsE.jpg","en":"Jason Schwartzman"},{"name":"Rip Torn","role":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"/jP74MHyQl6R8mH7aZKHrrD2Qjj2.jpg"},{"name":"Eleanor Coppola","role":"Self","photo":"/cSaflK0aquTDiQfeViUPhApVU4j.jpg"},{"name":"فرانسیس فورد کوپولا","role":"Self","photo":"/3Pblihd6KjXliie9vj4iQJwbNPU.jpg","en":"Francis Ford Coppola"},{"name":"رز بیرن","role":"Self","photo":"/wR8YZlrewVW2FixRBrJcxaXU3R1.jpg","en":"Rose Byrne"},{"name":"Milena Canonero","role":"Self","photo":"/4CJUhZSbsj6W8Aoid7N1NBrBGji.jpg"},{"name":"رومن کوپولا","role":"Self","photo":"/dq454EhrDVKBsiYzuLr0IkKa18v.jpg","en":"Roman Coppola"},{"name":"Marianne Faithfull","role":"Self","photo":"/jDUoK3Lg4hL84kihErRvYtABwz4.jpg"},{"name":"Asia Argento","role":"Self","photo":"/dYbYNxMnqhNyAJyrPU7e2C9jcRz.jpg"}],"trailer":"CwPwUOdagkY","watch":{"